(Packmate Baggage Policy \(Workshop Data\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (This document contains fictional Packmate workshop rules.) Tj
T* (It is not real airline policy.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Explorer customers may bring one cabin bag up to 8 kg.) Tj
T* (2. Navigator customers may bring one cabin bag up to 10 kg.) Tj
T* (3. Cabin liquids must stay in containers of 100 ml or less.) Tj
T* (4. A 150 ml liquid container is not allowed in cabin baggage.) Tj
T* (5. Power banks must travel in cabin baggage, not checked baggage.) Tj
T* (6. Hiking poles must be placed in checked baggage.) Tj
T* (7. One foldable rain jacket is recommended on city trips in wet weather.) Tj
T* (8. Oversized baggage over 23 kg requires pre-booking.) Tj
T* (9. Medical liquids may need supporting documentation.) Tj
T* (10. Always verify final travel rules with your carrier.) Tj
